      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "。我们的游戏藏器于形，寓意于魂，它能帮助大家理清抗战脉络，让洛川会议、平型关大捷等历史事件鲜活可感",
      "timestamp": 1774406125.844795,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:35:25",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "。在角色与文献的对照中读懂战略思想的时代价值，锤炼辩证思维，厚植家国情怀",
      "timestamp": 1774406134.0216808,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:35:34",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "。最后我想请大家和我一起完成一封家书，不用写多就一句话，如果你回到1937年，你最想对那个年代的军人说一句什么",
      "timestamp": 1774406146.893795,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:35:46",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "？请大家在弹幕上多多留言，说你所想",
      "timestamp": 1774406151.005051,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:35:51",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "啊大家有非常朴素的这个朴素的言语会赢的，感谢有你们",
